  "This copy wasn't installed by Rivulet's own installer — a package manager, or a build from source — so whatever put it there is what updates it. Replacing the files from in here would only confuse it.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: This copy wasn't installed by Rivulet's own installer — a package manager, or a build from source — so whatever put it there is what updates it. Replacing the files from in here would only confuse it.",
  "This device's decoder gave up on the file. That is usually the audio: Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) and DTS are not licensed into the system webview, so a release carrying one plays as a picture with no sound, or not at all. An x264 release with AAC audio will play.": "Dekoderen på denne enheten ga opp filen. Som regel er det lyden: Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) og DTS er ikke lisensiert inn i systemets nettvisning, så en utgivelse med slik lyd spilles av som bilde uten lyd, eller ikke i det hele tatt. En x264-utgivelse med AAC-lyd vil spilles av.",
